# Tests

Stack: Vitest + Testing Library. Tests live in `src/test/` mirroring source names.

- One observable behavior per `it`. Names describe the behavior.
- Ban `toEqual({...full object...})` for objects with five or more fields. Use `toMatchObject` or per-field expects.
- No snapshot tests. No smoke tests.
- Domain tests use factories, not copy-pasted literals.
- Fake timers for clock/ETA tests.
